        <p><strong>How to use them:</strong> write to us at <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>. You can also change or delete some data directly in your account settings. We reply free of charge <strong>within one month</strong> of receiving your request. If a request is complex or we receive many, this can be extended by two more months, and we will tell you so within the first month. We may ask for information to confirm the request comes from you.</p>

